oumu
Copyright (c) 2026 hayatree

oumu is an independent Rust and CUDA implementation of VoxCPM2. It was written by following the reference
implementation step by step, so parts of it are translations of that code into another language, modified and
restructured (batched decoding, CUDA graphs, own kernels). Those parts derive from:

- VoxCPM (https://github.com/OpenBMB/VoxCPM)
  Copyright 2025-2026 OpenBMB, Apache License 2.0
  Model architecture and decoding loop, prompt assembly, splitting of multi-character CJK tokens, AudioVAE.
  scripts/hf_case.py also reproduces a few lines of UnifiedCFM.forward to replay the diffusion noise.

- Hugging Face Transformers (https://github.com/huggingface/transformers)
  Copyright 2020 The HuggingFace Inc. team, Apache License 2.0
  Tokenizer behaviour (BPE with byte fallback, Metaspace pre-tokenisation, added tokens).

The Apache License 2.0 is in LICENSE-APACHE. No model weights are included.
